    "title": "Collin Gosselin Speaks Out Against Reality TV & Social Media Families - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By John Witiw ,\n9 hours ago\nCollin Gosselin has opened up about his time as a kid growing up in front of cameras over the years, including the recent release of his own memoir. During a recent appearance, he took time to speak out against families who put kids in a position like he was in. At the time, he also got to enjoy a bit of a reunion.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
